Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:04.48,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,After driving off Mercurius, \None of the Seven Luminaries,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:07.44,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,and bringing back the \NElixir they requested,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:11.62,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,we received our reward from \Nthe nation and obtained glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:15.44,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,Even though we barely did anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:17.31,flashback,Lufas,0,0,0,,Glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:20.95,flashback,Lufas,0,0,0,,We don't need any of that, \Nso share it with Virgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.81,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,She approved of us claiming it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:25.86,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,but it didn't feel very good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:30.00,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,We were also called before the \Nemperor who governs this nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.88,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,and I was nearly forced into \Nmarrying the imperial Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.82,italics,Sei,0,0,0,,You could say it was pretty dicey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:42.64,Default,Virgo,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sei-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:43.74,Default,Sei,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:46.36,Default,Sei,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.35,Default,Gantz,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:51.60,Default,Gantz,0,0,0,,Now we just need to use the Elixir \Nto heal the guardian dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:56.11,Default,Petto,0,0,0,,The guardian dragon is \Njust beyond this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:00:58.08,Default,Petto,0,0,0,,I'll lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.19,Default,All,0,0,0,,Right!
