Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:49.89,Default,Lufas,0,0,0,,What is it, Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.34,Default,Sei,0,0,0,,Lufas-san, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:52.22,Default,Lufas,0,0,0,,Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:53.45,Default,Sei,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:54.90,Default,Sei,0,0,0,,Why do you have an RV?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.58,Default,Lufas,0,0,0,,It seemed fitting for long journeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:58.49,Default,Lufas,0,0,0,,Would you have preferred a truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:21:00.69,Default,Sei,0,0,0,,No, that's not the issue here. You see—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.07,Default,Luafs,0,0,0,,We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:03.90,Default,Luafs,0,0,0,,Well, we can't go into detail,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:08.03,Default,Luafs,0,0,0,,but we happen to have a little \Nknowledge about that world too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:09.98,Default,Sei,0,0,0,,Huh? I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:18.15,Default,Lufas,0,0,0,,Now, we should be going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:21.08,Default,Lufas,0,0,0,,Our destination was Tyrving, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:22.01,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:22.97,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,However…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:25.93,Default,Aigokeros,0,0,0,,That might prove slightly troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:29.92,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,Mjolnir is right next to Tyrving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.74,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,That's the country governed \Nby the Seven Hero, Benetnasch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.18,0:21:36.43,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,Benetnasch is different from \Nthe other Seven Heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:37.97,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,She's the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.97,0:21:40.16,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,who's maintained the power \Nshe held in her prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.51,0:21:42.90,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,She's unusually obsessed \Nwith you, Lady Lufas,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:47.38,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,and killing you with her own \Nhands is her greatest goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:49.37,Default,Dina,0,0,0,,She's the most dangerous being there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:52.89,italics,Lufas,0,0,0,,Benetnasch…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:55.83,Default,Benetnasch,0,0,0,,I can feel you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:58.81,Default,Benetnasch,0,0,0,,Let's continue where we left off that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:00.55,Default,Benetnasch,0,0,0,,my archenemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.05,Default,Benetnasch,0,0,0,,This time, I shall kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.23,0:22:08.40,Default,Benetnasch,0,0,0,,Lufas Maphaahl!

